window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The end is near...are you prepared?</b></p> <p>In the stunning conclusion to the <i>Nuclear Dawn</i> series, Logan and Dakota and their found family must prepare for the fight of their lives in order to defeat an enemy more powerful than they've ever faced.</p> <p>Not only are the lives of everyone they love on the line, so are the lives of tens of millions of innocent people. The future of America hangs precariously in the balance. The stakes couldn't be higher.</p> <p>Because another apocalypse is coming. One that is far worse than anything that has come before. And in a country devastated by nuclear fallout, only Dakota knows who is orchestrating the destruction—and how to stop it.</p> <p>But in this war, the cost of victory may be too terrible to bear.</p> <p>Kyla Stone is the <i>USA Today</i> bestselling author of more than 25 novels, with over two million copies sold worldwide. <i>Darkest Night</i> is the stunning conclusion to the apocalyptic <i>Nuclear Dawn</i> series, a survival thriller featuring compelling characters, nail-biting suspense, and twists ripped from the headlines. Perfect for fans of <i>SILO</i>, <i>The Walking Dead</i>, and <i>The Last of Us.</i></p> <p>Rated PG-13 for mild cursing and violence.</p>"; 
